  "id": "mathematics-anxiety",
  "term": "mathematics anxiety",
  "definition": "Mathematics anxiety is a negative emotional response to mathematics marked by fear, tension, avoidance, and feelings of inferiority related to math. It can interfere with learning in the short term and may also affect later academic achievement and career development.",
